      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "4️⃣ agent-api ↔ Keycloak\nPOST /token\n  code + code_verifier\n\nValidate:\n- state matches cookie\n- JWKS signature\n- iss, aud, nonce, exp\n\nExtract claims:\npreferred_username, email,\ngroups",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#5b21b6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
