      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "7️⃣ Tool Execution (if LLM requests)\nMCPHTTPClient.call_tool(\n  \"filesystem__read\",\n  {\"path\": \"/tmp/file.txt\"}\n)\n\nPOST /mcp\n  {\"method\": \"tools/call\", \"params\": {...}}\n\nReturn result to agent",
