      "y": 1280,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "8️⃣ Agent Loop (ReAct)\nInsert tool result into history\n→ Call LLM again with updated history\n→ LLM decides: more tools OR final reply\n\nRepeat until agent stops\n\nReturn final reply + tool_calls[]",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
