      "width": 330,
      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "9️⃣ Persist & Return\nUpdate history (trim to 40 turns)\nSerialize ChatSession to dict\nStore in Redis: aigw-chat:sid:*\nSet TTL: access_token_exp - now() + 30s\n\nReturn JSON to browser:\n{\"reply\": \"...\", \"tool_calls\": [...]}",
